{"ref":"character:tera","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Tera is a secret playable character introduced in the 2025 update of the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Grand_Cross.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"weapon:grand-cross"}," ",{"t":"Grand Cross","r":"weapon:grand-cross"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_TERA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Tera_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Grand_Cross.png","w":16,"h":15,"r":"weapon:grand-cross"}," ",{"t":"Grand Cross","r":"weapon:grand-cross"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Slay 10,000 Red foes that deny Death."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-80%"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["+20%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Slay 10,000 Red foes that deny Death.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", Tera can be unlocked by permanently destroying a total of 10,000 ",{"i":"Sprite-Scarleton.png","w":10,"h":12}," Scarleton and/or ",{"i":"Sprite-Skulorosso.png","w":5,"h":9}," Skulorosso. For example, the player can defeat 4,999 Scarletons and 5,001 Skulorosso. This also applies retroactively."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Tera can be unlocked in the ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"skelenun\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Tera starts with -80% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", which depreciates to -60% at level 2, -30% at level 3, then entirely gone at level 4. She also starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Tera.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Tera's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Tera.gif","w":80,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Tera's cooldown not being reduced by overhealing"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Tera","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Tera"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"PowerUp-Growth.png","w":40,"h":40}]},{"k":"p","c":["Stub"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article is a stub. You can help Vampire Survivors Wiki by ",{"t":"expanding it","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Tera?action=edit"},"."]}],"